# Pairs with LinkObligationDurable. This is the ordering reported in #4795: the
# donor completes the split and holds the result only in memory, with no durable
# marker. A root crash before the link intent is persisted strands the sibling.
MODULE: LinkObligationDurableNoMarker
TARGET: LinkObligationDurable
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: completing a split leaves no durable record of the link obligation
PERTURBS: FinishSplit

--- FIND
    /\ phase' = "done" /\ held' = TRUE /\ marker' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the pre-fix ordering, no donor marker.
    /\ phase' = "done" /\ held' = TRUE /\ marker' = FALSE
--- END
